The technical program of the 23rd ACM International Conference on Modeling, Analysis, and Simulation of Wireless and Mobile Systems (MSWiM), exceptionally held virtually in November 2020, highlights the high standard of past editions of the conference. In 2020, the call for papers attracted the relevant number of 100 submissions for review in all areas of
